1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,690
The most powerful man in AI just admitted an affair.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:04,240
And this isn't just gossip.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:09,000
The CEO of Nvidia, Jensen Huang, told his staff he was unfaithful to his wife.

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:13,070
Reports say the woman was being watched by US intelligence over ties to China.

5
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,200
She hasn't been charged.

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:18,920
Nvidia's board opened an investigation, and says it has no reason to believe any secrets leaked.

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,120
So why is the whole AI world watching?

8
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:24,110
Because Nvidia makes most of the chips that power today's AI.

9
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:26,260
It's worth about four and a half trillion dollars.

10
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:29,480
On Monday, the stock fell about five percent.

11
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,840
Next week, Nvidia reports earnings.

12
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:34,080
The day after, Congress wants answers.

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,880
If trust in Nvidia cracks,

14
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:40,280
every AI company built on its chips feels it.

15
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,080
So, should he stay as CEO?

16
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:42,980
Comment below.
